<title>UK: Eyecare ceo Andre Cohen resigns.</title>
<headline>Eyecare ceo Andre Cohen resigns.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Eyecare Products Plc said on Tuesday that chief executive Andre Cohen had resigned &quot;over differences in the management and future direction of the company&quot;.</p>
<p>The firm said that Alan Cox will assume responsibility for Eyecare UK for the time being.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
